/* Help text */
"Indicates which side has the next move - you can change who has the next move, in particular after board detection from screenshot." = "显示下一手轮到哪一方，你可以更改下一手方，尤其是在从截图识别后。";
"Changes the viewing orientation only." = "仅改变视图朝向。";
"Rotates the board without moving the pieces. If a1 was bottom left before it will be top right afterwards. This helps to correct boards when board detection did not accurately guess which side was black or white. Affects which direction white or black pawns move." = "旋转棋盘但不移动棋子。若之前 a1 在左下，旋转后在右上。用于纠正识别时黑白方判断错误。影响白方或黑方兵的移动方向。";
"Import a screenshot and run board detection. You can alternatively drag the screenshot on the chessboard." = "导入截图并进行棋盘识别。也可将截图拖到棋盘上。";
"Return the board to starting position." = "将棋盘恢复到初始布局。";
"Step backward or forward through move history." = "在走法历史中后退或前进。";
"Controls how deep the engine searches. Higher is slower but more accurate. Search depth 30 is very slow." = "控制引擎搜索深度。越高越慢但更准确。深度 30 非常慢。";
"When on, waits for all lines to reach the target depth before returning. Slower but more accurate." = "开启后会等待所有线路达到目标深度再返回。更慢但更准确。";
"Number of distinct move variations shown." = "显示的不同变招数量。";
"How many best lines to request from the engine." = "从引擎请求的最佳线路数量。";
"How many arrows to draw for each line." = "每条线路绘制的箭头数量。";
"Limits engine strength for bot play. Higher is stronger." = "限制机器人对弈强度。越高越强。";
"Introduces strength randomness for the bot move. 1 - no randomness, 5 - high randomness." = "为机器人走法引入随机性。1 无随机性，5 高随机性。";
"Auto-respond with a bot move after you play." = "你走棋后自动回复机器人走法。";

